  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AUDA-NEPAD - FARA Promoting food systems in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the AfricanUnion Development Agency NEPAD to strenghten the African food systems dialouges and establish an African position and work program on Food Systems following up  the UN-Food system summit (2021) in collaboration with Forum for Agricultural Research in Africa (FARA).. The support will enable the countries to develop and implement a food system work program under AU.</narrative>
  </description>
